# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processor types {#processor-types}"
msgstr "Jenis-jenis Prosesor {#processor-types}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processor types are named for the general technology qualities that go into builds, consisting of the family and revision. Family (for example, Heron) refers to the size and scale of circuits possible on the chip. This is primarily determined by the number of qubits and the connectivity graph. Revisions (for example, r3) are design variants within a given family, often leading to performance improvements or tradeoffs.\n"
msgstr "Jenis prosesor dinamai berdasarkan kualitas teknologi umum yang digunakan dalam pembuatannya, terdiri dari keluarga dan revisi. Keluarga (misalnya, Heron) mengacu pada ukuran dan skala sirkuit yang dapat dijalankan pada chip. Hal ini terutama ditentukan oleh jumlah qubit dan grafik konektivitas. Revisi (misalnya, r3) adalah varian desain dalam keluarga tertentu, yang sering kali menghasilkan peningkatan performa atau pertukaran.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Supported instruction set\">\n"
"To find the supported instruction set for a backend, use [this code](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates-ops). You can see all supported instructions in [this table](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Gate dan operasi native\">\n"
"Untuk menemukan gate dan operasi native dari sebuah backend, gunakan [kode ini](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates-ops). Anda bisa melihat semua gate dan operasi native di [tabel ini](/guides/qpu-information#native-gates).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As new processor families are added, older families are retired.  See the [Retired processor families](retired-qpus#families) section to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Seiring ditambahkannya keluarga prosesor baru, keluarga yang lebih lama akan dipensiunkan. Lihat bagian [Keluarga prosesor yang dipensiunkan](retired-qpus#families) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Nighthawk {#nighthawk}"
msgstr "Nighthawk {#nighthawk}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Nighthawk processor icon](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/nighthawk.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Ikon prosesor Nighthawk](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/nighthawk.svg)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With a grid topology, Nighthawk leverages our technology stack from Heron (couplers, signal delivery, and coherence) with increased connectivity for enhanced application workloads.\n"
msgstr "Dengan topologi grid, Nighthawk memanfaatkan tumpukan teknologi kami dari Heron (coupler, pengiriman sinyal, dan koherensi) dengan konektivitas yang lebih tinggi untuk beban kerja aplikasi yang lebih baik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[View available Nighthawk processors](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Nighthawk)\n"
msgstr "[Lihat prosesor Nighthawk yang tersedia](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Nighthawk)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
