#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`r2` (September 2026) The second version of Nighthawk, with 120 programmable qubits and 458 physical qubits, including a high speed reset on each qubit which significantly increases the maximum number of circuits per second.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`r1` (December 2025) The first version of Nighthawk, with 120 qubits.\n"
msgstr "  `r1` (Desember 2025) Versi pertama Nighthawk, dengan 120 qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Heron {#heron}"
msgstr "Heron {#heron}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Heron processor icon](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/heron.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Ikon prosesor Heron](/docs/images/guides/processor-types/heron.svg)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At 156 qubits, Heron is an Eagle-sized upgrade to Egret that pulls in substantial innovations in signal delivery that were previously deployed in Osprey. The signals required to enable the fast, high-fidelity two-qubit and single-qubit control are delivered with high-density flex cabling.\n"
msgstr "Dengan 156 qubit, Heron adalah peningkatan berukuran Eagle dari Egret yang membawa inovasi besar dalam pengiriman sinyal yang sebelumnya telah diterapkan pada Osprey. Sinyal yang diperlukan untuk mengaktifkan kontrol dua-qubit dan satu-qubit yang cepat dan berketelitian tinggi dikirimkan dengan kabel flex berkerapatan tinggi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[View available Heron processors](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Heron)\n"
msgstr "[Lihat prosesor Heron yang tersedia](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?processorType=Heron)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Revisions\">\n"
"  `r3` (July 2025) Heron r3 is the result of targeted manufacturing improvements that directly impact coherence, gate fidelity, and readout performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Revisi\">\n"
"  `r3` (Juli 2025) Heron r3 adalah hasil peningkatan manufaktur yang ditargetkan yang secara langsung berdampak pada koherensi, fidelitas gate, dan performa readout.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `r2` (July 2024) This is a revision of the original Heron processor. The chip has been redesigned to include 156 qubits in a heavy-hexagonal lattice. While continuing to make use of the innovations of the original Heron processors, it also introduces a new TLS mitigation feature that controls the TLS environment of the chip, thereby improving coherence and stability across the whole chip.\n"
msgstr "  `r2` (Juli 2024) Ini adalah revisi dari prosesor Heron asli. Chip telah dirancang ulang untuk menyertakan 156 qubit dalam kisi heavy-hexagonal. Sambil tetap memanfaatkan inovasi dari prosesor Heron asli, versi ini juga memperkenalkan fitur mitigasi TLS baru yang mengontrol lingkungan TLS chip, sehingga meningkatkan koherensi dan stabilitas di seluruh chip.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `r1` (December 2023) The first version of Heron with 133 qubits.\n"
msgstr "  `r1` (Desember 2023) Versi pertama Heron dengan 133 qubit.\n"
